  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chimpili and Chilongo Small Hydropower Projects, through Kleinschmidt Associates</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant to Hydro Electric Power Limited, a privately-owned renewable power developer and operator in Zambia, funds a feasibility study for the development of a portfolio of small hydropower projects in Zambia, including two greenfield small hydropower projects for application under the Zambia GET FiT program and the expansion of an existing small hydropower project. The Study will assess the technical and economic viability of the sites and provide the data and analysis necessary to secure financing for implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
